// ============================================================================
//  mod_betty.zone  -  the MP Bouncing Betty's assets (user task 4, 2026-08-30).
//
//  Every asset exists in fastfiles build_ff.bat ALREADY --load's - the models,
//  anims and fx in common_mp.ff, the two HUD icon materials split between
//  common_mp.ff (hud_bounce_betty) and code_post_gfx_mp.ff
//  (hud_bounce_betty_256; common_mp carries that one only as a bare reference,
//  the leading-comma form the XPR-50's zone banner warns about). No new
//  --load was needed.
//
//  The weapon def ships raw (weapons\zm\bouncingbetty_zm, 18,577 B) - the same
//  route as every other ported weapon. The zombie-side behaviour lives in
//  scripts\zm\bouncingbetty.gsc.
//
//  t6_wpn_bouncing_betty_world_detect and fx_betty_light_red are deliberately
//  NOT declared: recon-detection and enemy-team lights are MP concepts with no
//  observer in zombies. fx_betty_destroyed likewise - zombies cannot shoot the
//  mine out.
//
//  v2.9.25 - THE HELD-MINE PRESENTATION, the fix for the broken first-person
//  viewmodel. The MP betty ships only idle/fire/ads viewmodel anims - in MP it
//  is planted from the equipment slot, never carried - so as a held zombies
//  weapon every raise, sprint and crawl had NO anim and the hands froze/clipped.
//  BO2-Reimagined's zombies betty (runtime-proven, sanctioned reference) solves
//  it with the campaign TC6 mine's full held-mine anim family driving an EMPTY
//  gun model (t6_wpn_none_view), the betty mesh attached to tag_weapon with
//  offsets (X -5, pitch -90). The def now mirrors that scheme exactly.
//    - the 17 viewmodel_mine_tc6_* anims the def references exist in NO zombies
//      fastfile - donor is so_cmp_afghanistan.ff, a NEW --load (carries the
//      full set; verified by Unlinker --list 2026-09-01, and the three d2p
//      dive-to-prone anims re-verified 2026-09-10 - without them the hands
//      froze going prone with the Betty held).
//    - t6_wpn_none_view / t6_wpn_none_world come from zm_prison.ff, already
//      loaded.
//    - viewmodel_claymore_empty_idle (emptyDropAnim) is resident in ALL six
//      map fastfiles - not declared here.
//  The four viewmodel_bouncing_betty_* anims below are no longer referenced by
//  the def but stay declared: un-owning them costs a relink A/B for zero gain.
// ============================================================================

xmodel,t6_wpn_bouncing_betty_view
xmodel,t6_wpn_bouncing_betty_world
xmodel,t6_wpn_none_view
xmodel,t6_wpn_none_world

xanim,viewmodel_bouncing_betty_idle
xanim,viewmodel_bouncing_betty_fire
xanim,viewmodel_bouncing_betty_ads_up
xanim,viewmodel_bouncing_betty_ads_down

xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_idle
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_fire
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_hold_fire
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_quick_pullout
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_putaway
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_sprint_in
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_sprint_loop
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_sprint_out
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_crawl_in
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_crawl_forward
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_crawl_back
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_crawl_right
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_crawl_left
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_crawl_out
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_d2p_in
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_d2p_loop
xanim,viewmodel_mine_tc6_d2p_out

fx,weapon/bouncing_betty/fx_betty_explosion
fx,weapon/bouncing_betty/fx_betty_launch_dust
fx,weapon/bouncing_betty/fx_betty_light_green

material,hud_bounce_betty
